# Audited: `Twice` gives 2 whatever function it is given; a click changes nothing shown.
# The tests of ts-ch04-whole-lambda-reads-hold-in-lifted-call (Type System chapter 4).
emit Ui.*
use App.*

test a_whole_lambda_reading_a_hold, @shown:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="twice 2")
    click Ui.Button(label="Inc")
        => expect Ui.Label(text="twice 2")
